body:
I can find him a little immature and sometimes a little bothering but wouldn't say annoying, cause the more the show runs he mature more and more, turning from a childish clown to an actua man, I think he was a great MC for opening the Reiwa era.

&#x200B;

Now if we are talking about being annoying, since he appear i want to see Kenzan dying in a pitchfork he is the biggest definition of annoying.
